  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "熬夜赶论文  (Staying Up Late Over Hotpot)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Over late-night hotpot with her classmate Qin Xiao, Bu Xiaogu reflects on Professor Fang's media-ethics advice, talks about singer Xin Huimei's controversial new single cover, and admits she has barely slept. Listen first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "火锅好了，快吃吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师教过我们，每一件小事都很重要。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "做媒体一定要小心自己传播的内容。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你看，辛惠美发了新歌！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这次的封面不符合惠美的形象。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "现在网上大家只看热闹。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "快把这杯酸梅汤喝了吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你是不是最近熬夜太凶了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "公司里有好多工作要做。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "而且我的论文还没写完呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你太拼了，要注意身体啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我没事，放心吧！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's unpack what the two friends say over dinner.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "火锅好了，快吃吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The hotpot is ready — eat up!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师教过我们，每一件小事都很重要。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Professor Fang taught us that every small matter is very important.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "做媒体一定要小心自己传播的内容。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Working in media, you must be careful about what you spread.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你看，辛惠美发了新歌！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look, Xin Huimei released a new song!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这次的封面不符合惠美的形象。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This cover does not match Huimei's image.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "现在网上大家只看热闹。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Online nowadays, everyone just watches the drama.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "快把这杯酸梅汤喝了吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hurry and drink up this glass of sour plum drink.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你是不是最近熬夜太凶了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you been staying up way too late recently?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "公司里有好多工作要做。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is so much work to do at the company.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "而且我的论文还没写完呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And on top of that, I have not finished writing my thesis yet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你太拼了，要注意身体啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are pushing yourself too hard; take care of your health!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我没事，放心吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am fine, do not worry!'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "火锅好了，快吃吧！",
      "gap": 0.5
