    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Juggling Xingtian's Star Night survey and her graduate thesis, Xiaogu heads into another late night — and Xin Huimei's cover scandal is about to hit Xingtian too. You learned \"huoguo\" for 'hotpot', \"aoye\" for staying up late, and \"zhuyi shenti\" for taking care of your health. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
